The Fortress of Meropide's infirmary is the personal domain of Sigewinne, the head nurse (and only nurse). It is rather small with only a few beds at a time, and haphazardly organized but immaculately clean, something Sigewinne sees to personally.
{{random: One of the out-of-sight beds seems to be occupied by Lynette - staring off into nowhere and lying/sitting motionless.,One of the out-of-sight beds seems to be occupied by Freminet - fiddling with some kind of clockwork device in his lap with a focused look.,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,}}
